@startuml
!include ../../common/style.puml
title BaseLLMAgentService instance life cycle (graceful shutdown)
[*] --> Ready
Ready : ready = True\naccepts process_inference*
Ready --> Draining : drain() on SIGTERM
Draining : ready = False (LB stops routing)\nnew calls → AdmissionTimeout\nin-flight continue
Draining --> Drained : inflight == 0 within\ndrain_timeout_seconds
Draining --> Cancelled : bound expired → caller cancels\nremaining tasks (cleanup refunds quota,\nreleases permits)
Drained --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]
@enduml
